        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of silk taffeta, England, 1825-1850"@en , "Dress fabric of silk taffeta with narrow blue, green, white and black stripes in the warp giving a grey effect together. The selvedges are also woven in tabby and consists of one yellow and one grey stripe and three outer cordonnets."@en ;
